  m_Name: memory_3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CozyFishing.Story.CutsceneDef
  id: memory_3
  titleEN: "Memory III \u2014 The Iron River"
  titleID: "Kenangan III \u2014 Sungai Besi"
  memory: 1
  music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3da5ac83c4bd77f4e80e1484990b8e80, type: 3}
  slides:
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 49e2f4b462e1324418751c6aaf8a01fc, type: 3}
    textEN: When I was young and proud, I fought the ironscale sturgeon of Pinefall
      Gorge for a whole afternoon.
    textID: Saat aku masih muda dan sombong, aku melawan sturgeon sisik besi di Ngarai
      Pinefall sepanjang sore.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 21122fd474d25fa4891ef8161527a4fc, type: 3}
    voiceID: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7d1c21354a09d394499ebc527fadb56d, type: 3}
    voiceM: {fileID: 0}
    voiceMID: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 5.5
    zoomFrom: 1.04
    zoomTo: 1.14
    panFrom: {x: 0, y: 0}
    panTo: {x: 0.02, y: -0.02}
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 40e9feede709cda498d64d4ca1b1e177, type: 3}
    textEN: I pulled too hard. The rod snapped, and the line with it. I was furious
      with the river.
    textID: Aku menarik terlalu keras. Joranku patah, dan senarnya juga. Aku marah
      sekali pada sungai.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 058523c110a13094d8e5fd6b0d1c6cc0, type: 3}
    voiceID: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d9d4a4deec046b546a32368c11d2a783, type: 3}
    voiceM: {fileID: 0}
    voiceMID: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 5.5
    zoomFrom: 1.04
    zoomTo: 1.14
    panFrom: {x: -0.02, y: 0.01}
    panTo: {x: 0.02, y: 0}
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: befb9fee24ef5f54f9881050abbe5316, type: 3}
    textEN: 'It took me years to learn: strength is knowing when to give line. Pull
      with the river, never against it.'
    textID: 'Butuh bertahun-tahun untuk belajar: kekuatan adalah tahu kapan harus
      mengulur. Tarik bersama sungai, jangan melawannya.'
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fb00c3dbb7f87a947b29c13232cad584, type: 3}
    voiceID: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 17caac37220b59e4cb07414196fc5911, type: 3}
    voiceM: {fileID: 0}
    voiceMID: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 5.5
    zoomFrom: 1.04
    zoomTo: 1.14
    panFrom: {x: 0.02, y: -0.01}
    panTo: {x: -0.01, y: 0.02}
